{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10044","headline":"东郊纳凉忆左威卫李录事收昆季太原崔参军三首 一 · 楼頴","name":"东郊纳凉忆左威卫李录事收昆季太原崔参军三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水竹谁家宅，幽庭向苑门。\n今知季伦沼，旧是辟疆园。\n饥鹭窥鱼静，鸣鸦带子喧。\n兴成秪自适，欲白返忘言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"楼頴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10044.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10044","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}